WEBVTT

00:30:29.187 --> 00:30:30.935
The novel is called "City of Girls."

00:30:30.959 --> 00:30:33.094
It takes place
in New York City in the 1940s,

00:30:33.118 --> 00:30:35.982
and it's about showgirls
in the New York City theater world,

00:30:36.006 --> 00:30:40.541
It came out of an idea I had
of wanting to write a book

00:30:40.565 --> 00:30:43.195
about women who are not
traumatized by sex.

00:30:43.219 --> 00:30:47.496
It is very difficult to find that story
anywhere in literature.

00:30:47.520 --> 00:30:52.439
Women are so punished in art for desire,

00:30:52.463 --> 00:30:53.875
and they're so brutalized,

00:30:53.899 --> 00:30:57.705
and that has not personally
been my experience with sex,

00:30:57.729 --> 00:31:00.794
and it hasn't been the experience
of a lot of women that I know.